  "realization": {
    "description": "Fire the Jester's fallen-star musket toward the cursor. Its reusable shot uses the native fallen_star ammunition category, with Terraria's native ammo-saving handling. A shot moves quickly and then arcs downward; it can hit up to three NPCs before spending its penetration. Each hit releases one smaller, 6-damage star that slowly homes toward a nearby NPC for up to 1.2 seconds. The weapon's base use interval is about 0.53 seconds.",
    "playerExperience": "Fallen stars are the recurring cost. The primary shot retains the musket's 31 base damage, while the short-lived follow-up stars add a small chance to finish or pressure nearby targets after a hit.",
    "selfEvaluation": ""
  }
